Subject: [PATCH 18/20] content(rfidak): production model, commercial terms and
 certificate registry as single-source constants
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Owner decision 2026-09-02 ("待决策项以 rfidak.com 的口径为准"; D-04, D-05, D-09,
K-11, K-12). Every generated surface now states what rfidak.com — same
legal entity — states, from one place (src/lib/seo-content.ts; evidence in
AUDIT_2026-09-01/phase14/RFIDAK_REFERENCE_FACTS.md):
- production model: 'in-house specification and quality control; tooling
  and production executed on contracted partner lines in Shenzhen' — trust
  strip, hero trust bar, about trust band, home-v2 evidence card, homepage
  snapshot paragraphs and footer tagline, llms.txt / llms-full.txt header and
  Quick facts (owned-by / partner-line split)
- COMMERCIAL_TERMS (every product page + Product additionalProperty): MOQ
  from 500 pcs cards/keyfobs/wristbands, 1,000 tags/labels, stock from 100,
  custom tooling 2,000-5,000; standard production 7-15 business days from
  order confirmation; free standard samples prepared in 1 business day with
  DHL/FedEx freight (5-60) refunded against the first order; 30% T/T
  deposit / 70% before shipment, L/C or 50/50 for established accounts,
  PayPal under 00; FOB Shenzhen; first reply 2-4 h in business hours,
  written quote 24-48 h valid 30 days
- ORGANIZATION_OPERATIONS.moq / leadTime / response / samples / payment /
  productionModel feed llms.txt Quick facts
- response promises on the RFQ wizard, inline RFQ / sample-pack form,
  homepage process step and quote-target block: 2-4 h first reply,
  24-48 h written quote (was 'one business day')
- certificates: OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 23.HCN.97349 (Hohenstein, product
  class II, UHF laundry tag — checked valid in the OEKO-TEX Label Check
  2026-09-02) added as a product certification and to hasCredential on
  /about/certifications/; RoHS / REACH SVHC / CE(EN 62311) carried as the
  sample-based test reports they are, with their numbers
- authorship: EXPERT_AUTHORS resolves the editorial-team record,
  EDITORIAL_REVIEWER the engineering function; llms.txt attribution line
  updated; wristband MOQ 200 -> 500 per rfidak (supersedes the 2026-07-15
  ruling noted in the code comment)
